{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"My recollection is that Rafa’s practitioner estimate is **about 2% of the creation/redemption value** as a typical maximum variable fee—not the routine charge or a universal ’40 Act ceiling.\n\nI don’t reliably recall the cited **Corgi ETF Trust I SAI’s exact cap**, so I shouldn’t quote it from memory.\n\n**Worth knowing:** An industry rule of thumb is not a substitute for a particular fund’s filed terms; those determine its disclosed maximum and applicable conditions."}}
